# [[.DisplayName]] Android app

Native Android application using Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Hilt, MVVM, and the
repository pattern. It targets Android API 37.

```bash
gradle test
gradle assembleDebug
gradle installDebug
```

A Gradle wrapper is intentionally not included because generated wrapper JARs
must come from a trusted Gradle installation. Run `gradle wrapper`, commit the
resulting wrapper files, then use `./gradlew`. Requires JDK 17 and an Android
SDK with API 37.

Application ID: `[[.Org]].[[.Package]]`. API base: `[[.APIURL]]`.
